  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nSave 15% on orders over $50 ♡ Use code 15OFF at checkout\n\nCart\nGlowing skin, naturally\n\nIndulge in plant-based skin care for naturally radiant results.\n\nShop now\nShop our most trusted formulas\nSale\nLip Balm\nRegular price\n$19.00 CAD \nSale price\n$16.00 CAD\nMonoi Conditioner\nRegular price\n$28.00 CAD\nTurmeric Konjac Sponge\nRegular price\n$16.00 CAD\nSale\nNail Polish: Atwater\nRegular price\n$20.00 CAD \nSale price\n$16.00 CAD\n1\n/\nof\n3\n“Our mission is to provide high quality products that are not tested on animals and are completely safe for the environment.”\n\nMarilyne, Founder\n\nSold out\nBody Lotion\nRegular price\n$36.00 CAD\nEverything Body Soap\nRegular price\n$10.00 CAD\nSale\nMonoi Shampoo\nRegular price\n$32.00 CAD \nSale price\n$28.00 CAD\nVegan\n\nOur entire collection is vegan and cruelty free.\n\nNatural\n\nWe only use the finest\nnatural ingredients.\n\nRecyclable\n\nAll packaging is recyclable and eco conscious.\n\nCompostable\n\nOrders are shipped with biodegradable peanuts.\n\nSkin Care\nBody Care\nNail Polish\n1\n/\nof\n3\nGet 20% off your first order\n\nJoin our email list for exclusive offers and the latest news.\n\nEmail\nMenu\nSkin Care\nHair Care\nBody Care\nNail Polish\nBlog\nAbout Us\nOur Store\n\n3455 St Laurent Blvd\nMontreal, Quebec H2X 2T6\nMon - Fri 9 a.m. - 7 p.m.\nSat - Sun 10a.m. - 6p.m.\n\n\nOur Promise\n\nTo create high quality, plant-based products that are safe for people and the planet.\n\nTwitter\nFacebook\nPinterest\nInstagram\nTikTok\n© 2026, theme-sense-demo Powered by Shopify"
